{"reviewId": "3215729_87PQVGReA", "review": {"abstract": "我们对康波表象的基本认识，实际上就是康波中增长与通胀的关系。任何周期的机制都可以理解为价格对增长的反制，康波也不例外。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "也就是经济增长的惯性。当经济增长形成惯性依赖，一旦红利消退，资源配置没有及时做出改变，在相关商品价格上就会出现通胀，而调整的过程就是滞胀", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "4132-4191", "createTime": 1774317450, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "3215729_87PQVGReA", "userVid": 3215729, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 3215729, "name": "拿捏小面团", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UcdjjDD5LEFyGn3703HBMuRribudnNC65U0r0PCsL8Hs9E6PiaOoy41U9UHfg5aLJ3h6IxARnCPvKicb3Xa9LlHB49mcjic8zeicvajibl2hDic4fI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "在红利期，迅速发展过程中，投资的规模效应明显，形成乘数效应，这放大了扩张势头，但也带来了转向的艰难处境。", "reviewId": "3215729_87PQVGReA", "commentId": "3215729_87PQVGReA_c3215729_87PR7KlVw", "userVid": 3215729, "createTime": 1774317629, "author": {"userVid": 3215729, "name": "拿捏小面团", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UcdjjDD5LEFyGn3703HBMuRribudnNC65U0r0PCsL8Hs9E6PiaOoy41U9UHfg5aLJ3h6IxARnCPvKicb3Xa9LlHB49mcjic8zeicvajibl2hDic4fI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0